e-spiritedness of his friend, whose musical life began with discovering the 10-stringed tiple as a teenager in the 1950s and ended with his death a year ago, aged 84, on the verge of him releasing his album The Final Painting, now being released posthumously this month.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/21/ed-askew-psych-folk-bill-callahan">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ubL5ljydtyF9cStJEEXwczwmDHMdQA8eksFX6Wznlckƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;IIPT-pqDtLy9yGD_ZhpnRjU8RUdkZWiCOGrxKc4vbdIƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6QT8XvDs5SznKjba4vxn0zYZJu_jAFrvVAzRaxaXKlIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KoI68UWE6sun9KTvaXTtOCRxOq_zq6smFw_KcbUzejAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vUUR9gR70EiI-7nJdB-yOS6WOGWhjYkCWGQdFAhBJM4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;aIQ3cTK3ef9ROKOHuXJDfVfAOMDucv4zj0C9eF92_K4ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;e4lUno0jf1pD1EHfjuEr7XIEflaplbPzbR8dOl8uaqsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kkWERbp3hp4vUkTcbqA-_CDQZbr-1ETdNvViPuQl7Zoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cp3IryFDy8MsTUjQmIgyh0yV-3v_6G1LUmHAx6TydKQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftds